  m_Name: Yodinha
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nameEnglish: Yodista
  descriptionEnglish: "Unlike the other exorcists, YoDa wasn't trained for this war\u2014he
    was dragged into it.\n\nDuring a live stream, the energy of his legion of fans,
    the Yodistas, opened a rift between worlds and summoned him to hell. There, he
    discovered that striking the 'Y' pose protects him from corruption, channeling
    the strength of his community into raw firepower.\n\nHe doesn't fight for an
    ancient creed, but to protect those on the other side of the screen, bringing
    the \"trabson\" to the apocalypse."
  nameChinese: Yodista
  descriptionChinese: "\u4E0E\u5176\u4ED6\u9A71\u9B54\u4EBA\u4E0D\u540C\uFF0CYoDa\u5E76\u975E\u4E3A\u8FD9\u573A\u6218\u4E89\u63A5\u53D7\u8BAD\u7EC3\u2014\u2014\u4ED6\u662F\u88AB\u62D6\u5165\u5176\u4E2D\u7684\u3002\n\n\u5728\u4E00\u6B21\u76F4\u64AD\u4E2D\uFF0C\u4ED6\u7684\u7C89\u4E1D\u519B\u56E2\u201CYodistas\u201D\u7684\u80FD\u91CF\u6495\u5F00\u4E86\u4E16\u754C\u95F4\u7684\u88C2\u9699\uFF0C\u5C06\u4ED6\u53EC\u5524\u5230\u4E86\u5730\u72F1\u3002\u5728\u90A3\u91CC\uFF0C\u4ED6\u53D1\u73B0\u6446\u51FAY\u5B57\u9020\u578B\u80FD\u4FDD\u62A4\u4ED6\u514D\u53D7\u8150\u5316\uFF0C\u5E76\u5C06\u4ED6\u793E\u7FA4\u7684\u529B\u91CF\u8F6C\u5316\u4E3A\u7EAF\u7CB9\u7684\u706B\u529B\u3002\n\n\u4ED6\u5E76\u975E\u4E3A\u53E4\u8001\u7684\u4FE1\u6761\u800C\u6218\uFF0C\u800C\u662F\u4E3A\u4E86\u4FDD\u62A4\u5C4F\u5E55\u53E6\u4E00\u7AEF\u7684\u4EBA\u4EEC\uFF0C\u5C06\u201Ctrabson\u201D\u5E26\u5230\u4E86\u672B\u65E5\u4E4B\u4E2D\u3002"
  namePortuguese: Yodista
  descriptionPortuguese: "Diferente dos outros exorcistas, YoDa n\xE3o foi treinado
    para esta guerra \u2013 ele foi arrastado para ela.\n\nDurante uma transmiss\xE3o
    ao vivo, a energia de sua legi\xE3o de f\xE3s, os Yodistas, abriram uma fenda
    entre os mundos e o convocou para o inferno. L\xE1, ele descobriu que fazer o
    Y o protege da corrup\xE7\xE3o, canalizando a for\xE7a de sua comunidade em poder
    de fogo bruto.\n\nEle n\xE3o luta por um credo antigo, mas para proteger aqueles
    do outro lado da tela, trazendo o \"trabson\" para o apocalipse."
  nameSpanish: Yodista
  weaponDescriptionSpanish: "A diferencia de los otros exorcistas, YoDa no fue entrenado
    para esta guerra, sino que fue arrastrado a ella.\n\nDurante una transmisi\xF3n
    en vivo, la energ\xEDa de su legi\xF3n de fans, los Yodistas, abri\xF3 una brecha
    entre los mundos y lo convoc\xF3 al infierno. All\xED, descubri\xF3 que hacer
    la pose de la 'Y' lo protege de la corrupci\xF3n, canalizando la fuerza de su
    comunidad en poder de fuego bruto.\n\nNo lucha por un credo antiguo, sino para
    proteger a aquellos del otro lado de la pantalla, trayendo el \"trabson\" al
    apocalipsis."
  shortName: Yodista
